<div class="tib"><div class="lab">TIBETAN (WYLIE)</div>
<span class="u" data-d="1" data-l="s268S"><span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s268w1">dang por</span> <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s268q1">gang du</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s268w2">gnas pa</span> de yang <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s268w3">&#x27;gro ba</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s268w4">gsum</span> po de&#x27;i <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s268w5">rang rang</span> gi <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s268w6">thun mong ma yin pa</span>&#x27;i <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s268w7">las</span> la <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s268q2">brten nas</span> grub pa&#x27;i <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s268w8">snod kyi &#x27;jig rten</span> <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s268q3">gang nas</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s268w9">blangs pa</span> de nyid du grub pa yin te, <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s268w10">mi&#x27;i</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s268w11">thun mong ma yin pa</span>&#x27;i <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s268w12">las</span> la <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s268q4">brten nas</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s268w13">grub</span> pas <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s268w14">mi&#x27;i</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s268w15">&#x27;jig rten</span> gyi <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s268w16">chu</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s268w17">dvangs</span> shing <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s268w18">bsil ba</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s268p1">nas</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s268w19">blangs</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s268p2">na</span> de nyid du <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s268w20">gnas pa</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s268w21">sogs</span> yin pa&#x27;i phyir</span>
