<div class="eng"><div class="lab">GESHE MICHAEL'S ENGLISH (VERBATIM)</div>
<span class="u" data-d="1" data-l="s268S"><span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s268q1">How</span> the glass of liquid <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s268w2">exists</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s268w1">originally</span> all depends on the particular <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s268w8">outer world</span> <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s268q3">from where</span> it has been <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s268w9">taken</span>, for <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s268w5">each</span> of the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s268w4">three</span> different <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s268w3">beings</span> has a different outer world, <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s268q2">depending on</span> the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s268w6">specific</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s268w7">karma</span> he himself has collected. <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s268p2">If</span> the glass of liquid were <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s268w17">sweet</span>, <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s268w18">cool</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s268w16">water</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s268w19">taken</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s268p1">from</span> the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s268w15">world</span> of <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s268w14">humans</span>--a world <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s268w13">created</span> <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s268q4">by</span> the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s268w11">specific</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s268w12">karma</span> of the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s268w10">human</span> in the group--then that would be its original <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s268w20">condition</span>, <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s268w21">and so on</span>.</span>
</div>
